    "description": "Finding a condominium with a private garage is almost as rare as spotting Karl the Fog on a sunny day. But here, the extraordinary is the norm. And the garage is only the beginning. Picture a leisurely lifestyle just past the threshold with a lavish king-sized bed nested within a sumptuous bedroom retreat, a perfectly appointed kitchen, a spotless bathroom and an open floor plan boasting endless opportunities for seamless entertaining. From slow Sunday mornings to laughter-filled evenings, this home is a beautiful backdrop for unforgettable moments. In the garage, imagine having room to park two cars side-by-side, store supplies for any occasion, workout in your carefully curated home gym or start a weekend hobby whenever you feel the inkling. And when it's time to invite friends to visit, you can do it with the peace of mind knowing they can reliably park in front of your driveway without any fuss or hassle. An extraordinary experience for you and everyone you welcome into your extraordinary home."
